  "finding": "FourfoldSnapshot canonicalizes its four PlaneSnapshot records into FOURFOLD_PLANES order during construction, but strict Boolean relation projection called snapshot.plane_map on every projected block. plane_map materializes a fresh dict and MappingProxyType each access even though relation projection only needs the already-canonical source and target plane records.",
  "gardener_change": "Relation projection now resolves endpoint planes directly from the immutable canonical snapshot.planes tuple using FOURFOLD_PLANES. Same-plane signatures reuse the already-resolved source PlaneSnapshot as the target as well. This removes a redundant per-block mapping materialization without adding a cache, index, second lookup abstraction, graph authority, Tensor type, backend, store, registry, scheduler, semantic plane or public product surface.",
  "focused_regressions": [
    "Same-plane code->imports->code projection remains exact while FourfoldSnapshot.plane_map is monkeypatched to raise on access.",
    "Cross-plane code->documents->knowledge projection remains exact under the same plane_map refusal, pinning canonical tuple lookup for both endpoint shapes."
  ],
